### Variables
@port = 8080

### Health check (plain text-protocol COM_QUERY)
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/health

###

### Get all users (prepared statement)
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/users

###

### Get the first two users
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/users?limit=2

###

### Get user with ID 1
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/users/1

###

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Sarah",
  "last_name": "Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@example.com",
  "username": "sarahconnor",
  "age": 35
}

###

### Create the same user again (should return 409, MySQL error 1062)
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Sarah",
  "last_name": "Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@example.com",
  "username": "sarahconnor",
  "age": 35
}

###

### Update user with ID 2
PUT http://localhost:{{port}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "username": "janesmith",
  "age": 29
}

###

### Place an order for user 2 (transaction: INSERT order, UPDATE order_count, COMMIT)
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/users/2/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total": 99.95
}

###

### List orders for user 2
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/users/2/orders

###

### Delete user with ID 5
DELETE http://localhost:{{port}}/users/5

###

### Get a missing user (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/users/999

###

### Update a missing user (should return 404)
PUT http://localhost:{{port}}/users/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Non",
  "last_name": "Existent",
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "username": "nonexistent",
  "age": 25
}

###

### Order for a missing user (should return 404, transaction rolled back)
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/users/999/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total": 10.00
}

###

### Create user with invalid JSON (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Invalid"
  "last_name": "User"
}
